    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Nebukadineza ahesha ekishushani ky'ezahabu, kikaba kiina obwemi emikono 60, n'obukika emikono 60, akyemeleza omu ruhita rwa Dura, omu mukoa gwa Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Omukama aragira kweta abagavana, abami, abaramuzi, abakuru n'ab'ahansi, abahanika n'abakuru bona b'emikoa kwija kufukamira elya mbere ekishushani ekyo Nebukadineza wenene yabaire ataireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abagavana, abami, abategeki, abaramuzi, abakuru n'ab'ahansi, abahanika n'abakuru bana b'emikoa bahurura kufukamira elya mbere ekishushani eky'Omukama Nebukadineza yataireho, bakyemelera omu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugambilizi agamba n'eiraka lihango ati, “Inywe bantu b'amahanga n'enganda, n'ab'endimi zitali zimoi, nimuragirwa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo murahulira amakondere, enkuli, enanga, emilere, enyimba, eningili n'ebikwato byona by'omuziki eby'engeli ezisigaire mugwe ahansi mufukamire ekishushani ky'ezahabu eky'Omukama Nebukadineza ataireho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wena arayanga kugwa ahansi kukifukamira aho n'aho baramunaga omu tanuru elikumengeta omuliro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo embaga yona, ab'amahanga n'enganda, n'ab'edini zitali zimoi, kabahuliire amakondere, enkuli, enanga, emilere, enyimba na buli kikwato ky'omuziki, bagwa ahansi bafukamira ekishushani ky'ezahabu eky'Omukama Nebukadineza yataireho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kanya ako Abakalidayo bamoiho baija balega Abayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baija obuso bagambira Omukama Nebukadineza bati, “Kamelere Rugaba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, oragire buli muntu arahulira amakondere, enzamba, enanga n'ebikwato by'omuziiki ebisigaire, kugwa ahansi akafukamira ekishushani ky'ezahabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi okwo arayanga kugwa ahansi kukifukamira bamunage omu tanuru elikumengeta omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haliho Abayahudi nanka abo wataireho kulebelera omukoa gwa Babiloni nabo ni Shediraki, Meshaki na Abedinego, bayanga. Rugaba, abashaija abo tibalikukukunira n'akake. Tibalikufaho baruhanga bawe n'akake; nangu n'ekishushani ky'ezahabu eky'otaireho tibalikukunda kukifukamira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Nebukadineza asinsimuka, aragira kuleta Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego. Babaleta obuso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza ababaza ati, “Ky'amazimakwo iwe Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego timulikukolera baruhanga bange mara nimwanga kufukamira ekishushani ky'ezahabu ekyo ntaireho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu kamuraba muragwa ahansi orwo murahulira enzamba, n'enkuli, n'enanga, n'amakondere, n'emilere, n'amalimba n'ebikwato byona by'omuziiki, mukafukamira ekishushani ekyo mpesire, aho ebigambo biraba bihoire; kyonkai kamutakifukamire, barabatwara bwangu babanage omu tanuru elikumengeta omuliro. Ni ruhangaki arabaihya omu mikono yange?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego bahorora Omukama bati, “Rugaba Nebukadineza, titulikwetaga kuhorora aha kigambo ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'oratunaga omu tanuru elikumengeta omuliro, Ruhanga waitu owo tukolera aratujuna. Kandi Mukama osingire, Ruhanga ogwo aratwiha omu mikono yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe k'araba atatukoleire atyo, okimanye waitu Mukama okwo tutakolere baruhanga bawe anga kufukamira kishushani kya zahabu ekyo otaireho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Nebukadineza asinsimuka, amaisho gamutukura aha rwa Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego. Aragira kukanyisa etanuru emirundi mushanju kushaga okwo yahembwaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuba aragira abashaija ebishoka ab'omw'ihelye kukoma Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego kubanaga omu tanuru elikumengeta omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho babakoma, okwo bajwete emyendo yabo: Ekanzu, ebebo, ekofira n'emyendo endijo, babanaga omu tanuru elikumengeta omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etanuru y'omuliro ekaba neyokya muno munonga nk'okwo Omukama yaragiire. Omuliro gurambaramba abanagiremu Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego, abashatu aba bagwa omu muliro okwo babohirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama Nebukadineza atangara, abaratuka. Agambira abantu ati, “Titwanaga mu tanuru bantu bashatu bakomire?” Bamuhorora bati, “Rugaba nikwo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahorora ati, “Kyonkai inye nimbona abantu banai nibagendagenda omu muliro, kandi tibalikuhya; n'emibonekere y'owa kanai neshusha omoiho omu baruhanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Nebukadineza agoba aha munwa gw'etanuru elikumengeta omuliro, agamba ati, “Inywe Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego, abakozi ba Ruhanga Rukirabyona, rugayo, mwije aha.” Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego baruga omu muliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagavana, abami n'abaramata b'Omukama bahurura, babona abashaija abo tibayokibwa muliro. Eishoke lyabo tilyababuukire n'emyendo yabo tiyabaire kantu, kandi tibanukire rwika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
