              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza agamba ati, “Asingizibwe Ruhanga wa Shadiraki, Meshaki na Abedinego, ayatuma omumalaikawe kwihura abairube abamwesiga; kandi ebyo ndagiire akabisheshamu amaizi, bakaikiliza kufa kushaga kufukamira baruhanga abandi shana Ruhanga owabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
