            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo nintaho omuku ogu: Omuntu wena wena anga eihanga anga orulimi abalirogota ahali Ruhanga wa Shadiraka, Meshaki na Abedinego achwagachwagurwe, n'enjuye ekamburwe; taliyo ruhanga ondijo ashobora kurokora bantu ati.”",
          "type": "text",
